#. さっさとロッカーを調べろ…
msgctxt "0001 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hurry up and check the locker."
msgstr ""

#. その為に、ここまで来たんだろう…
msgctxt "0002 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "That's what we're here for, after all."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>桜の木が植えられている。しかも満開だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This cherry tree is in full bloom.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なんて、見とれてる場合じゃないな。
#. 捜査をしないと…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I don't have time to appreciate its beauty. I need to\n"
"keep searching..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>桜の木が植えられている。しかも満開だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This cherry tree is in full bloom.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なんて、見とれてる場合じゃないな。
#. 捜査をしないと…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I don't have time to appreciate its beauty. I need to\n"
"keep searching..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>木製のロッカーがある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are wooden lockers here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここの鍵も…
#. 銭湯の鍵みたいだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They use woodblock keys, just like at those super\n"
"traditional public bathhouses.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり、霧切さんの部屋で拾ったのって、
#. このロッカーの鍵だったんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like the key we found in Kyoko's room really\n"
"does go to one of these lockers...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木、右端のロッカーを見てみろ…
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Makoto, do you see the locker farthest to the right?"
msgstr ""

#. あのロッカーにだけ、
#. 鍵が差し込まれていないようだぞ…
msgctxt "0011 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That's the only one that doesn't have a key in it at\n"
"the moment."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、どういう事かわかるな？
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "You understand what that means, right?"
msgstr ""

#. あそこに、さっきの鍵を差し込めばいいんだよね？
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I should probably use the key we found on that locker,\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

#. やってみろ…！
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Well? Just try it!"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay..."
msgstr "Ừ-Ừm..."

#. <CLT 4>木の札を取り出し、
#. ロッカーの金具部分へと差し込むと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I took out the woodblock key and inserted it into the\n"
"locker's metal lock, and...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「カチャ…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Click*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鍵は見事に吸い込まれ、
#. そして、ボクはロッカーを開けた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The locker eagerly accepted the key, and it opened.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>矢が入ってる…
#. 全部で１０本くらいはありそうだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are...arrows in here. It looks like...ten arrows\n"
"in total.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>ジュラルミン製の矢<CLT>だな。
#. 細さの割に、かなり頑丈なはずだ。
msgctxt "0020 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"They look like they're made of <CLT 3>titanium<CLT>, which means\n"
"they're quite strong despite how thin they are."
msgstr ""

#. ただし、弓がなければ、
#. ただの頑丈な細い棒でしかないがな…
msgctxt "0021 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Of course, without a bow they're nothing but strong\n"
"little sticks."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>頑丈な…細い棒か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Strong...sticks...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>ジュラルミン製の矢<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Titanium Arrows<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>えっと、このロッカーの中…
#. 他には…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Oh, there's something else inside the locker...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>丸められたガムテープが転がっている。
#. しかも、このガムテープに付着しているのって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a wadded up ball of duct tape. I wonder what this\n"
"was used for...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>血痕…だよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is that...a bloodstain?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 血痕という事は…
#. これも事件に関係している物かもしれんな。
msgctxt "0027 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If it is, that means it must surely be related to the\n"
"case."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このガムテープが、事件に関係している…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This duct tape is related to the case somehow...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、関係してるって…
#. どう関係しているんだろう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...how could it possibly be involved?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>血痕の付着したガムテープ<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Bloody Duct Tape<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ロッカーの中で気になったのは、
#. これくらいか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I think that's all the locker has to offer for now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>鎧が飾られている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A suit of armor is on display.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ジャパニーズスタイルだって事以外に、
#. 気になる事は特にないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There isn't anything notable about it, other than it\n"
"being extremely Japanese.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>巻き藁がある…
#. 稽古に使うんだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a straw post used for sword practice. Did they\n"
"use it for training here, too...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>気になる事は特にないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Nothing is catching my attention, though...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>遠くに的が見える…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That target seems pretty far away.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>目が疲れるな…
#. 無理して覗きこむのはやめよう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I kinda have to strain to see it. Better stop, it's\n"
"starting to give me a headache...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おい…
#. まだ調べるべき事があるだろう…
msgctxt "0038 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Hey. I think it would be wise to look around a bit\n"
"more."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0039 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 十神クン、どうしたの…？
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is something wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. …妙だとは思わんか？
msgctxt "0041 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It's very odd, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#. このロッカーには、
#. 明らかに事件に関係している物が入っていた。
msgctxt "0042 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The locker was hiding items that were clearly related\n"
"to the case."
msgstr ""

#. だが、そんなロッカーの鍵が、
#. どうして被害者である霧切の部屋にあったんだ…
msgctxt "0043 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But how did the key to the locker wind up in the\n"
"victim's room...?"
msgstr ""

#. いや…ひょっとすると…
msgctxt "0044 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Or...perhaps..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0045 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …十神クン？
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Byakuya...?"
msgstr ""

#. …いや、なんでもない。
msgctxt "0047 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Forget it."
msgstr ""

#. それより、次の場所に急ぐぞ。
msgctxt "0048 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Come on. We need to continue on to the next location."
msgstr ""

#. …え？　次の場所？
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? What next location?"
msgstr ""

#. まだ調べなければならない事が
#. あったはずだ。
msgctxt "0050 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "There's still something we need to look into."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>フェンリル<CLT>だ…
#. フェンリルについて調べるぞ…
msgctxt "0051 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "We need to do more research on <CLT 3>Fenrir<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. …フェンリルって！
#. 戦刃むくろがいたっていう傭兵部隊だよね？
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Fenrir...? You mean the mercenary group that Mukuro\n"
"was a part of?"
msgstr ""

#. でも…調べるって、
#. どうやって…！？
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But...how are we supposed to find out about that?"
msgstr ""

#. 決まっているだろう。調べ物と言ったらどこだ？
msgctxt "0054 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Isn't it obvious? Where in this school would you go to\n"
"do research on something?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>調べ物と言ったら…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Research...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 図書室の…あの<CLT 3>書庫<CLT>…！？
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are you talking about...the <CLT 3>archive<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. そうか…世間に公表されていない情報まで揃ってる、
#. あの書庫にだったら…
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's right... The archive has all kinds of info that\n"
"the general public doesn't have access to."
msgstr ""

#. …学級裁判まで時間がない。急ぐぞ。
msgctxt "0058 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"We only have so much time before the trial begins.\n"
"Let's hurry."
msgstr ""
